# NixOS cluster — Phase 1 dotenv fallback template for secretspec.
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE — copy to /etc/nixos/.env.secrets and populate
# `replace-me-locally` placeholders with real values. Phase 1 (this
# template) only requires dotenv and env providers to resolve secrets for
# hosts where the corresponding sops-nix backing file does not exist yet.
#
# Real values must NOT be committed to git. The populated /etc/nixos/.env.secrets
# must be chmod 0600 and added to /etc/nixos/.gitignore. The sops-nix registry
# (modules/system/sops-secrets-registry.nix) is the LIVE resolver for entries
# that have a backing .age file — dotenv here is a last-resort fallback.
#
# Phase 2: this file shrinks as cachix/secretspec#98 lands and the sops
# provider takes over. Wallet-key primitives (ETHEREUM_WALLET_KEY,
# MONERO_WALLET_KEY) are intentionally absent — per sops-provider-design.md
# "Wallet key blocklist" they MUST NOT route through OS keyring or dotenv.
# They resolve via sops:// in Phase 2 or onepassword:// for daily-use.
#
# BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY is allowed here because it is blocklisted from
# keyring:// (master age encryption keys are exfiltratable by local
# malware via OS keyring) but dotenv:// with chmod 0600 .env.secrets is
# acceptable for Phase-1 fallback. When sops:// routes are live, this line
# should be removed.

# === AI services ============================================================
NVIDIA_API_KEY=replace-me-locally
OPENAI_API_KEY=replace-me-locally
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=replace-me-locally
OPENAI_ORG_ID=replace-me-locally
HUGGINGFACE_TOKEN=replace-me-locally
STABILITY_API_KEY=replace-me-locally
REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=replace-me-locally

# === CI ======================================================================
GITHUB_TOKEN=replace-me-locally
GITHUB_RUNNER_PAT=replace-me-locally
